{"vid":"mZa7dme8F1c","source":"mZa7dme8F1c.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.6,"txt":"(upbeat music)"},{"t":10.7,"txt":"- My name's Stan Riddle."},{"t":11.8,"txt":"I'm the Technical Training Supervisor for Acoem USA,"},{"t":15,"txt":"and I've been doing precision alignment of machinery"},{"t":17.9,"txt":"for about 42 years."},{"t":20,"txt":"- My name's Eric McKeefer."},{"t":21.6,"txt":"I've done shaft alignment just a handful of times."},{"t":24.1,"txt":"Today, I'm using the AT-100."},{"t":26.3,"txt":"It is a laser shaft alignment system"},{"t":28.7,"txt":"that pairs with the horizontal shaft alignment app."},{"t":31.9,"txt":"- This little contest we're gonna do,"},{"t":33.9,"txt":"just to be honest and upright and straightforward"},{"t":37,"txt":"with everybody,"},{"t":38,"txt":"I roughed in alignment on both of these machines"},{"t":40.8,"txt":"and they are, as far as I could tell,"},{"t":42.7,"txt":"with a straight edge,"},{"t":43.8,"txt":"the same."},{"t":44.9,"txt":"A rough demand vertically and horizontally,"},{"t":47.3,"txt":"we minimize the soft foot,"},{"t":49.2,"txt":"we tighten the bolts down in a controlled,"},{"t":51,"txt":"repeatable pattern."},{"t":52.1,"txt":"Same thing we always do"},{"t":53.7,"txt":"in our alignment training classes we teach."},{"t":56,"txt":"So these two alignment demonstrators"},{"t":57.9,"txt":"should be just about exact clones of each other."},{"t":61,"txt":"So the only variable is gonna be"},{"t":63.1,"txt":"if the old grizzled guy with the dial indicators"},{"t":65.8,"txt":"can do this as quickly as the young man using the AT-100."},{"t":71.2,"txt":"(bright music)"},{"t":76.3,"txt":"(numbers beeping)"},{"t":98.5,"txt":"- Laser heads are connected."},{"t":102.4,"txt":"- And I'm mounting up my brackets."},{"t":105.2,"txt":"You know, one of the challenges, I guess,"},{"t":106.9,"txt":"with shaft alignment, using dial indicators,"},{"t":109.4,"txt":"is it does take a little time"},{"t":110.6,"txt":"to get indicator brackets together,"},{"t":112.6,"txt":"get good travel on 'em and all those things."},{"t":114.7,"txt":"So that it is one of the drawbacks,"},{"t":117.1,"txt":"but they're still very accurate measuring tools."},{"t":119.4,"txt":"So we'll see how it goes."},{"t":121.3,"txt":"- Okay, I got my angle set,"},{"t":123.9,"txt":"(music intensifies)"},{"t":130.3,"txt":"taking in dimensions,"},{"t":142,"txt":"taking first measurement,"},{"t":145,"txt":"(dramatic music)"},{"t":148,"txt":"second measurement."},{"t":151.1,"txt":"- While he's taking measurements,"},{"t":152.4,"txt":"I have to keep up with direction"},{"t":154,"txt":"of rotation of these indicators,"},{"t":155.6,"txt":"to make sure they're going positive or negative."},{"t":158.4,"txt":"Make sure they don't roll around to the midpoint."},{"t":160.9,"txt":"And I think it's positive, but it's really negative."},{"t":163.5,"txt":"So it is a little bit slower."},{"t":173.1,"txt":"And now that I've taken my three measurements,"},{"t":175.6,"txt":"I have to calculate the 6 o'clock measurement,"},{"t":177.8,"txt":"using a validity rule."},{"t":180.8,"txt":"- Grabbing my shims"},{"t":185.6,"txt":"for a vertical adjustment."},{"t":192,"txt":"- I have just set my indicators at half travel,"},{"t":195.1,"txt":"so these are really gonna be measuring live as well."},{"t":199.3,"txt":"So I can calculate the shim values pretty much in my head"},{"t":202.6,"txt":"or I could graph it out."},{"t":205.1,"txt":"(suspenseful music)"},{"t":217.5,"txt":"They should be fairly close vertical,"},{"t":219.3,"txt":"so I'm gonna roll around to horizontal,"},{"t":222,"txt":"and I can use the jacking bolts"},{"t":223.8,"txt":"to make this final correction, hopefully."},{"t":226.9,"txt":"First correction complete,"},{"t":230.3,"txt":"remeasure."},{"t":233.8,"txt":"Now that would work..."},{"t":239.3,"txt":"- Second measurement."},{"t":240.8,"txt":"- And my challenge is,"},{"t":241.7,"txt":"is when I move one set of jacking bolts,"},{"t":244.2,"txt":"it changes all the indicator numbers."},{"t":246.2,"txt":"So I have to kinda sneak up on it,"},{"t":248.9,"txt":"do a little at a time to make sure I don't overshoot,"},{"t":252.5,"txt":"and make it worse instead of better."},{"t":256,"txt":"- Vertical is still slightly half."},{"t":264,"txt":"- Now I'm starting to remember why I like lasers."},{"t":271.9,"txt":"I still got some movement somewhere,"},{"t":273.4,"txt":"I'll have to do this again."},{"t":278.2,"txt":"Oh, let me check that one more time."},{"t":279.6,"txt":"Don't get too fancy,"},{"t":282,"txt":"make an old man look lame."},{"t":284.8,"txt":"- I'm doing my hopefully final measurement now."},{"t":292,"txt":"- Make some new circles, make that a large."},{"t":299.6,"txt":"Minus 16 for this,"},{"t":305.1,"txt":"get back over here."},{"t":312.9,"txt":"(intense music)"},{"t":314.5,"txt":"- All green,"},{"t":316.3,"txt":"done."},{"t":319.3,"txt":"(cool music)"},{"t":323.6,"txt":"- I'm as good with dials as anybody."},{"t":325.1,"txt":"I don't claim to be the best,"},{"t":326.4,"txt":"but I'm as good as anybody I know."},{"t":328.7,"txt":"We're using dial indicators to do shaft alignment."},{"t":331.6,"txt":"And I did a good alignment."},{"t":333.1,"txt":"I'm staying on zeros all the way around in 49 minutes."},{"t":337.5,"txt":"Not bad if you use dial indicators for shaft alignment,"},{"t":340.6,"txt":"using reverse dial indicator process."},{"t":343,"txt":"You gotta admit to yourself that's pretty good"},{"t":345,"txt":"most of the time."},{"t":346.8,"txt":"Eric, however, using a much better tool,"},{"t":351.1,"txt":"more accurate tool, faster tool, easier tool to use,"},{"t":354.9,"txt":"knocked out a good alignment in 16 minutes."},{"t":357.6,"txt":"- Yeah, compared to other shaft alignment tools I've used,"},{"t":360.2,"txt":"I felt this one was really accessible"},{"t":362.2,"txt":"for someone who didn't have experience."},{"t":364.6,"txt":"Using the AT-100 was pretty simple and easy."},{"t":367.5,"txt":"I caught a snag after my first measurement and adjustments,"},{"t":373.1,"txt":"but then the app told me exactly what I needed to do."},{"t":376.5,"txt":"Just change out a couple of the shims."},{"t":378.4,"txt":"I think maybe when tightening down"},{"t":380.4,"txt":"I had over-tightened or something."},{"t":382.5,"txt":"And after redoing that measurement"},{"t":386.3,"txt":"with the new shims in there,"},{"t":388.1,"txt":"and even double checking after that, I got all green checks."},{"t":391.1,"txt":"- So it's kinda like I'm driving a '62 Plymouth"},{"t":395.4,"txt":"and he's driving a Lamborghini."},{"t":397.3,"txt":"It really doesn't compare."},{"t":398.5,"txt":"It is not apples to apples, but it does show you this."},{"t":402.3,"txt":"Eric, with little to no shaft alignment experience,"},{"t":405.3,"txt":"but using a far superior tool,"},{"t":407.7,"txt":"is much faster, much more accurate, much more repeatable,"},{"t":412.6,"txt":"and doesn't have to run into the same problems I do,"},{"t":415.2,"txt":"taking analog measurements with an indicator,"},{"t":418.3,"txt":"as opposed to taking pretty high-tech,"},{"t":420.7,"txt":"precise digital measurements,"},{"t":422.7,"txt":"with the AT-100."},{"t":426.6,"txt":"(laughing)"},{"t":427.9,"txt":"Good job."},{"t":428.9,"txt":"(cool music)"}],"words":[{"t":0.648,"w":"(upbeat"},{"t":0.648,"w":"music)"},{"t":10.71,"w":"-"},{"t":10.71,"w":"My"},{"t":10.71,"w":"name's"},{"t":10.71,"w":"Stan"},{"t":10.71,"w":"Riddle."},{"t":11.85,"w":"I'm"},{"t":11.85,"w":"the"},{"t":11.85,"w":"Technical"},{"t":11.85,"w":"Training"},{"t":11.85,"w":"Supervisor"},{"t":11.85,"w":"for"},{"t":11.85,"w":"Acoem"},{"t":11.85,"w":"USA,"},{"t":14.957,"w":"and"},{"t":14.957,"w":"I've"},{"t":14.957,"w":"been"},{"t":14.957,"w":"doing"},{"t":14.957,"w":"precision"},{"t":14.957,"w":"alignment"},{"t":14.957,"w":"of"},{"t":14.957,"w":"machinery"},{"t":17.85,"w":"for"},{"t":17.85,"w":"about"},{"t":17.85,"w":"42"},{"t":17.85,"w":"years."},{"t":20.01,"w":"-"},{"t